s":""},"say:13:1210810011:1":{"text":"万一她是装的，等我们松懈了给我们一刀，后果不堪设想。","source_cn":"万一她是装的，等我们松懈了给我们一刀，后果不堪设想。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0C01C1EBC5AD92E9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1210810012:1":{"text":"你觉得，以她的逻辑和智商，她有演员的素养？","source_cn":"你觉得，以她的逻辑和智商，她有演员的素养？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x88074253417F6044","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1210810013:1":{"text":"哈！这个笑话一点也不好笑。","source_cn":"哈！这个笑话一点也不好笑。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFBDDC4DACCDACF48","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1210810014:1":{"text":"其实……是你心里更希望她失忆了吧。","source_cn":"其实……是你心里更希望她失忆了吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9BD229545012D9A5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1210810015:1":{"text":"也许是吧。","source_cn":"也许是吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD26C24D889511A92","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1210810016:1":{"text":"那就把她看好，别影响了我们寻宝。","source_cn":"那就把她看好，别影响了我们寻宝。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6BA782D9B4D78B6A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","var